OL,3,AIran attacks US bases in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter reports US strike killed five at
OL,5,Awedding party
OL,6,
OL,7,FTehran has launched missile and drone
OL,8,Fattacks at US targets in Jordan,
OL,9,FKuwait, Iraq and Bahrain after American
OL,10,Fforces resumed strikes against Iran on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FThe Iranian Red Crescent said five
OL,14,Fpeople, including a child, were killed
OL,15,Fand more than 50 injured when shrapnel
OL,16,Ffrom a US missile attack hit a home
OL,17,Fwhere a wedding celebration was taking
OL,18,Fplace in Sirik in southern Iran.
OL,20,FThe US military said it was aware of
OL,21,Fthe reports but that it never targeted
OL,22,Fcivilians.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
