OL,3,AIran attacks US bases in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter reports US strike killed five at
OL,5,Awedding party
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Central Command (Centcom) said US
OL,8,Fstrikes on Iran followed "recent
OL,9,Fattempted attacks" by Iran's elite
OL,10,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,11,F(IRGC) against commercial shipping in
OL,12,Fthe Strait of Hormuz and American
OL,13,Fforces in the region.
